  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lily's Dream
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Lily's Dream
  content: '"What I Want To Be When I Grow Up"


    Teacher says we can become anything
    if we work hard.

    Papa grows food.

    Mama makes the best soup in Springtide.

    I
    want to study at Frostmere one day.

    They have books about flowers, stars,
    and places nobody has ever seen.

    Maybe if I learn enough, I can discover
    why some plants bloom and others don''t.

    Papa says researchers help people
    in different ways.


    I think I''d like to do that too.'
